# RoyalRushMissionNpc (18150), a Royal Rush victim: created, it looks around and names the
# character it sees in its first line (sent as the NPC lines' NPCs spawn, before the first
# step), and calls for help every 5 s from then on.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.RoyalRushMissionNpc
npc victim 18150 Monster 40 0 0

advance 4s
advance 1s
  S NpcSay obj=victim type=0 npc=1018150 text="Help me!!"
advance 5s
  S NpcSay obj=victim type=0 npc=1018150 text="Help me!!"
